  "description": "Generate strongly-typed parsers from .whfmt binary format definitions — C#, zero-alloc Span<byte>, F#, or Rust. 757 binary formats supported. Rich types: enums for valueMap, [Flags] enum for bitfields, List<T> for repeating, nullable for conditionals. Typed exceptions: InvalidSignatureException, ChecksumMismatchException, TruncatedFileException. New: dump command for structured binary inspection. Install: dotnet tool install -g whfmt.CodeGen",
