  "releaseNotes": "1.1.1 — Added VB.NET output language (--lang vb): Public Class with BinaryReader, typed enums for valueMap, <Flags> enum for bitfields, List(Of T) for repeating fields, nullable for conditionals, big-endian ReverseBytes helpers. 1.1.0 — dump command, rich types, typed exceptions, C#-Span/F#/Rust output, --project flag.",
